  {
   "id": "nanoapostle-279485@major-2024-05-17",
   "gameId": "nanoapostle-279485",
   "displayName": "Demo Update (Patch notes)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-05-17T10:23:35.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Bugfixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed the bug where the commander stops acting after entering the second phase.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the bug where the commander's wreckage appears above Anita.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the bug where hacked drone are not destroyed after the commander is defeated.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Balancing",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the frequency and damage of Anita's light attacks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted and weakened some visual effects.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the commander's combat experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Player data gathering (Opt-in)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added a feature to collect gameplay information. (This allows developers to adjust the experience, and players can choose whether to send information at the start interface.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) 修正指揮官進入二階後有機會不再行動的錯誤",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) 修正指揮官的殘骸顯示在主角之上的錯誤",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) 修正指揮官戰敗後友方浮游炮沒有摧毀的錯誤",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4) 調整主角的輕攻擊頻率和傷害",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5) 調整並減弱部份視覺表現",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6) 調整指揮官的戰鬥體驗",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7) 新增收集遊玩資訊的功能 (供開發者調整體驗用, 玩家可以在起始介面選擇是否回傳資訊)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
